1 . Purpose

Layer 2 defines the behavioral-reflex operating system of the Mint-to Logic™ ecosystem.
It governs the creation, validation, suspension, and controlled retirement of every digital, physical, or biological credential.
This is the heartbeat of the living infrastructure—the logic that allows truth to function as computation.

